  "facts_of_case": "Petitioner is the wife of respondent. Their marriage was solemnized on 26.06.2011. Disputes arose between them and petitioner filed this petition to transfer O.P.No.973 of 2018 from Court of Additional Family Judge, Visakhapatnam to Court of learned Senior Civil Judge, Bhimavaram.",
